[
  {
    "text": "8/22、29晚上打？",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785674791.760208,
    "weight": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "租場地",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785674795.9216902,
    "weight": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "那你知道規則嗎 @黃聖穎",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785674855.2009668,
    "weight": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "知道啊",
    "user_id": "U3cd5b3c8ae4272b13d960a333705ac36",
    "ts": 1785675217.941736,
    "weight": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "不知道就問AI",
    "user_id": "U38f817726f256ec1fdfa51cf57f4a645",
    "ts": 1785675238.658154,
    "weight": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "失眠壓力會造成身體發炎，發炎會變成癌症",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785675475.033824,
    "weight": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "https://youtu.be/hJ3lspDPFzc?si=lPS7E1w3x3WlXlKd",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785675503.742916,
    "weight": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "戒掉超加工食品，超加工食品的油、鹽、糖都很多",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785675607.439491,
    "weight": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "西化飲食容易造成乳癌大腸癌",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785675688.587266,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "盡量支援型食物，例如直接吃肉而不要吃貢丸。",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785675744.553084,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "那你們可以嗎 19:00 @黃聖穎 @雅 @黃將修",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785675757.986028,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "可",
    "user_id": "U3cd5b3c8ae4272b13d960a333705ac36",
    "ts": 1785675844.366697,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "PM 2.5或更小的會鑽進肺跑進入血管，造成心肌梗塞造成腦霧",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785675860.0313642,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "空屋會造成肺腺癌。家裡的空屋可能由家具造成。有些家具很嗆，是因為有甲醛。",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785675930.969504,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "最好買沒有甲醛的家具",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785675941.902514,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "https://youtu.be/hJ3lspDPFzc?si=KaeSNLuuRnw2ORHo",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785676658.821027,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "家裡的毒來自黏著劑、壁紙 剛剛完成油漆的房子，最好挑沒有苯的油漆、霉菌，例如植栽土壤裡面產生的霉菌、壁癌、空氣濾網都可能有霉菌。還有塑化劑，不沙發、窗簾、",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785676698.396497,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "@Emily 你說你一直拉肚子，這個影片劉伯仁醫師提到生菜沙拉、或生的食物容易有沙門氏菌，你會不會是吃了便利商店的？生菜沙拉或其他的生食。譚敦慈說他不吃生的。",
    "user_id": "U9fde03d0fe1e0669eccc8b9b4ecc28a6",
    "ts": 1785676818.8658738,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "沒有我現在都自己煮",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785678824.216352,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "而且我今天暈倒三次",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785678827.712395,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "有一次撞到地板",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785678831.536257,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "其他都剛好跌在沙發上",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785678840.215054,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "我會外食也都是喝湯",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785678849.343385,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "我上禮拜五有外食",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785678855.703455,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "不知道是不是那次吃的東西不乾淨",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785678862.250089,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "禮拜六也有 但是健康餐",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785678869.743563,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "還有爸爸煮的",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785678874.114601,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "笑死",
    "user_id": "U32fa3b194d6aeac31d3eefdcf3fcec4a",
    "ts": 1785679685.9795232,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "蛤姐姐這次沒去喔",
    "user_id": "U32fa3b194d6aeac31d3eefdcf3fcec4a",
    "ts": 1785679698.981193,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "Ok",
    "user_id": "U32fa3b194d6aeac31d3eefdcf3fcec4a",
    "ts": 1785679739.43362,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "那穎你訂位",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785683248.131735,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "先訂8/22",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785683252.676523,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "19:00",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785683255.862089,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "我煮的，全家都有吃但沒有人啦肚子。",
    "user_id": "U38f817726f256ec1fdfa51cf57f4a645",
    "ts": 1785686330.0831208,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "今天打壁球用力太猛，右手臂有拉傷，大概要一陣子才會好",
    "user_id": "U38f817726f256ec1fdfa51cf57f4a645",
    "ts": 1785686393.896905,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "我知道我覺得是禮拜五吃的",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785686394.735174,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "蛤",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785686400.974848,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "你幹嘛那麼拼啦",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785686404.703218,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "那你去台大物理治療的時候",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785686410.102765,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "問看醫師可不可以復健手臂",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785686417.6256378,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "電療之類的",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785686421.803711,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "休息就會好",
    "user_id": "U38f817726f256ec1fdfa51cf57f4a645",
    "ts": 1785686468.296999,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "要先暖身",
    "user_id": "U32fa3b194d6aeac31d3eefdcf3fcec4a",
    "ts": 1785686515.1983502,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "還要收操",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785687101.847856,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "明天晚上炒飯",
    "user_id": "U38f817726f256ec1fdfa51cf57f4a645",
    "ts": 1785690478.2378519,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "爸爸每天下廚耶",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785690693.5058172,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "要記得蔬菜要多一點",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785690696.846936,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "蔬菜跟飯肉的比例要是2:1:1",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785690706.592861,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "健康",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785690709.030431,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "賢慧",
    "user_id": "U3b0075fe63139560ddc06555ab62462b",
    "ts": 1785690723.166889,
    "weight": 1
  },
